    "description": {
      "value": "<p>@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-effects.H9PmcSFAMvqh7Af3]{Spell Effect: Innkeeper's Magic}</p>\n<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to better interact with others. When you Cast the Spell, you can @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.1OagaWtBpVXExToo]{Recall Knowledge (Society)}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.plBGdZhqq5JBl1D8]{Gather Information}, @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{Make an Impression}, or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.DCb62iCBrJXy0Ik6]{Request}. You gain a +1 status bonus to the skill used for the roll, and this bonus remains as long as you Sustain the Spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Innkeeper's Magic.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>"
    },
